Package: rom-hamster
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: rom-hamster-gui
Description: retro game ROM library manager (command line)
 rom-hamster manages a retro game ROM library: platform detection from file
 extensions, two-phase import, SQLite-backed metadata, search and filtering,
 DAT verification, and export to front-end metadata formats (EmulationStation,
 ES-DE, Pegasus).
 .
 This package contains the command line front-end, the shared core library
 libromham-1.0.so, the system-wide configuration files and the manual page.

Package: rom-hamster-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rom-hamster (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-plugins-base,
            gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
            gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad,
            gstreamer1.0-libav
Description: retro game ROM library manager (GTK 4 graphical front-end)
 Graphical front-end for rom-hamster. It provides a list view of the library,
 a detail page showing metadata and media (covers, screenshots, videos,
 marquees), import progress with cancellation, and frontend manifest export.
 .
 It links against the same core library as the command line front-end and
 does not duplicate any storage or rule logic.

Package: rom-hamster-data
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: platform and front-end rules for rom-hamster
 Ships the read-only factory data used by rom-hamster: the platform rules
 database (extensions, arcade ROM suffixes, media directories and media
 suffixes, archive extensions), the front-end import/export specifications for
 EmulationStation, ES-DE and Pegasus, and the annotated configuration
 template.
